+ * "GetSwarmCount", a registered query of the same 13 bytes that ignores its arguments. The search runs
+ * on the outgoing buffer (after the window and the caches, which keep the file's real bytes), so it
+ * covers every copy of the script, whatever bundle it travels in: whatever the game reads, it reads it
+ * decompressed. The game data itself is not touched.
